1
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:50,440
What are you guys doing?

2
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:53,960
Stand there
and answer our questions honestly.

3
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,280
Did you have fun today?

4
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,320
The one who can make you happy

5
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,160
is the right one.

6
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,280
Wait, what's that light for?

7
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,520
I'm lighting it up for Chen Yanzhou.

8
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:10,160
Did Chen Yanzhou
walk you back to the dorm?

9
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:13,280
Did he walk you to the door?

10
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,080
How considerate!

11
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,880
I'm lighting it up for him too!

12
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:21,080
Did he say any sweet words to you?

13
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,760
Being considerate isn't enough.

14
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,000
He needs to express it.

15
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:28,000
Zheng Yu, I like you.

16
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,920
I get it.

17
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,040
I also give Chen Yanzhou the light.

18
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:37,080
So he has passed.

19
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,120
Wait.

20
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:40,240
One more question.

21
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,920
Have you two

22
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,240
kissed?

23
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,720
Of course not. What are you thinking?

24
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:49,920
We were too hasty.

25
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,760
Break it up.

26
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,160
Let's go to bed.

27
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,960
No fun!

28
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:01,000
Instead of buying tickets
to go home after your exams,

29
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,520
you stayed to poke fun at me?

30
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,920
Are we poking fun at you?

31
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,320
We're looking out for you.

32
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,080
Looking out for you. Got it?

33
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:10,120
- Exactly.
- You haven't dated before.

34
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,040
You're in the pre-dating stage.

35
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,880
We have to give you some advice.

36
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,760
Have you dated?

37
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:18,320
I haven't done it,
but I know how it works.

38
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:22,720
How is it the pre-dating stage?

39
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,640
How isn't it pre-dating?

40
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:26,080
Isn't it obvious?

41
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:28,080
I thought you were dating already.

42
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:30,360
No kiss means pre-dating.

43
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,400
That's right.

44
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,960
I'm deeply disappointed
with this progress.

45
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,280
The light isn't deserved.

46
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:40,480
The lights went out.

47
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,200
See?

48
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:46,040
Even those above turned off the lights.
Heaven is disappointed.

49
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,080
No way.

50
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,760
Calling so soon after parting?

51
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,080
Rookies.

52
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:54,720
Will we see progress before we go home?

53
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:57,320
DR. ZHAO

54
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,840
Hello?

55
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:08,040
<i>The patient suffered from a blood clot</i>
<i>that blocked the main artery in the lungs,</i>

56
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,600
<i>obstructing blood flow.</i>

57
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,600
<i>We are doing our best to save her.</i>

58
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:14,720
<i>But the situation isn't optimistic.</i>

59
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,440
<i>I have to return to surgery.</i>

60
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:19,399
<i>Zheng Yu, you should prepare</i>
<i>for the worst.</i>

61
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,080
Xiaomian.

62
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,640
Zheng Yu,

63
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,280
why don't you sleep for a bit?

64
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:19,920
You need to rest.

65
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,960
Don't worry about me.

66
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,760
Go to sleep.

67
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,520
Zheng Yu,

68
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:29,440
we'll go back to the hospital with you
to complete the procedures later.

69
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:33,240
No need. I can manage on my own.

70
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,040
Zheng Yu,

71
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:40,040
if you want to cry, then cry.

72
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,200
We're worried about you.

73
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,840
Thank you.

74
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,120
I really am fine.

75
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,440
Don't worry about me.

76
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,160
Why did you call me here?

77
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:29,400
Shouldn't you be off work at this hour?

78
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,720
The workday is over in China,

79
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,840
but it's just starting abroad.

80
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,440
What do you mean?

81
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,680
You were dragging your feet.

82
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,560
The application deadline was near,

83
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,280
so I got your transcripts

84
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,120
and submitted your application.

85
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:49,800
I hadn't heard back.
I thought there was no chance.

86
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,720
What a nice surprise.

87
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:55,560
By the way, Professor Cheng
wrote your recommendation letter.

88
00:06:55,640 --> 00:07:00,120
When she heard you were interested in
applying to do research on cancer cells,

89
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,600
she was very happy for you.

90
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,080
I'm not interested.

91
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,280
What I mean is,

92
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,000
I can do research in this area

93
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,320
even if I don't go
to this research institute.

94
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,880
It's just a matter of time.

95
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,440
Well, why waste time?

96
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:20,840
Put this aside.

97
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,520
Prepare for the interview first.

98
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:25,640
If you don't pass,
then that's the end of it.

99
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,120
I still…

100
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,920
Don't let Zheng Yu down.

101
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:31,600
I told her I would submit
your application for you.

102
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:35,680
After she heard, she immediately looked
into the relevant research.

103
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,920
Zheng Yu?

104
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,160
She knew about this?

105
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:42,040
You two are in the same research team.

106
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:46,000
She even gave me materials
related to your research

107
00:07:46,080 --> 00:07:47,680
to add to your resume.

108
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:53,640
Don't forget about the interview!

109
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,840
ZHENG YU

110
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:57,200
<i>Where are you? Let's meet up.</i>

111
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,800
CHEN YANZHOU:
WHERE ARE YOU? LET'S MEET UP.

112
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,600
Is she that busy?

113
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,800
Finals just ended.

114
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,840
Did she get a new part-time job?

115
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,360
ZHENG YU

116
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,520
ZHUANG NING

117
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,760
Hello, Zhuang Ning.

118
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,400
Is Zheng Yu at the dorm?

119
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,720
Zheng Yu!

120
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,400
I should have come sooner.

121
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,160
Today

122
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,160
was so busy.

123
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:18,240
Even if you had come,
I wouldn't have had time for you.

124
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,800
Ever since my mom's accident,

125
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:26,800
I've felt quite down on my luck.

126
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:31,560
But at least I had a goal.

127
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:35,480
I hoped she could live a little longer.

128
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:40,560
As long as she was alive,

129
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,440
there was still hope.

130
00:11:46,280 --> 00:11:48,320
But now my mom is gone.

131
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,640
My goal is gone.

132
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,160
Hope is gone too.

133
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:55,440
Chen Yanzhou asked me to bring these in.

134
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,520
Thank you.

135
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:16,880
CHEN YANZHOU

136
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,560
<i>I bought some food for you.</i>

137
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,680
<i>I asked Zhuang Ning to bring it in.</i>

138
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:24,080
<i>Even if you don't have an appetite,</i>
<i>fill your stomach first.</i>

139
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:26,920
<i>Also, if you can't sleep at night,</i>

140
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:28,520
<i>you can text me.</i>

141
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,320
<i>My phone won't be on silent.</i>

142
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:49,320
That's it? How long will it take you
to pay off the debt?

143
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:53,920
Even senior high students
are trying to play the hero.

144
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,200
You have some nerve coming
with chump change.

145
00:13:57,040 --> 00:14:01,280
I'll find a way to get money.
Don't bother my sister for a while.

146
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:05,040
What? You owe money and want
to observe a mourning period?

147
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,960
Listen,

148
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:08,720
debt collectors don't care!

149
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,480
Look at you.

150
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:22,320
Your sister can take more than you.

151
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,880
Just a few words,
and you're already so pissed.

152
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:28,480
Listen.

153
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:32,240
If you really want to help your sister,
get money from your uncle.

154
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,000
That's better than a summer job.

155
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:37,040
Will you stay away from my sister then?

156
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:38,720
I'll consider it.

157
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,680
Speak of the devil.

158
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:53,080
If you don't want me at your dorm,

159
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,600
then you had better come right now!

160
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,720
I called you here today

161
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:09,120
to make things clear to you.

162
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,880
Your mom is dead.

163
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:15,280
For you and for me, it's a good thing.

164
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:19,080
For you, it's a burden off your shoulders.

165
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:21,600
For me, I feel settled now.

166
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:25,240
Starting today, Jiang Mian is my son.

167
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,480
This is a fact set in stone now.

168
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:29,840
Nobody can take him away.

169
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:33,680
And what did I hear from Wu Liang?

170
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:35,720
You got a rich boyfriend.

171
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:38,360
As your uncle,

172
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:41,360
I was quite happy for you
after I heard this.

173
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,120
Here's my suggestion.

174
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:46,720
Rein in your nasty temper.

175
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,520
If you make him happy

176
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,480
and tie him down,

177
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,720
you'll get to live the good life, yeah?

178
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,920
I'm talking to you.

179
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:05,360
I want to ask you for a favor, Uncle.

180
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:09,360
Can you lend me some money?

181
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:17,640
The adjacent bed's family
paid Mom's emergency treatment bill.

182
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,240
I used all the money I have

183
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:22,120
on Mom's funeral arrangements.

184
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:25,120
The adjacent bed?

185
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:28,600
I remember that woman.

186
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,240
Her mom is also dying.

187
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:33,560
She's just waiting there every day.

188
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,880
Right?

189
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:41,680
I have to repay her as soon as possible.
Her mom is still sick.

190
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,840
Wait, Zheng Yu.

191
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:44,520
Are you kidding me?

192
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,760
I say, listen to me.

193
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,840
Not paying her back is helping her.

194
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,880
What happens if you pay her back?

195
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,880
The hospital profits in the end.

196
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:55,720
In my opinion,
she and you should get checked.

197
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:57,800
You both are wrong in the head.

198
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:00,160
What's this? You lay your mom to rest.

199
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,840
- Now it's her turn?
- Repeat that!

200
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:03,680
What did you say about my sister?

201
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:05,200
You're hitting me?

202
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:06,880
Little brat!

203
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,400
Do you have a conscience,
hitting your dad?

204
00:17:10,319 --> 00:17:11,720
- Ungrateful boy!
- Jiang Mian!

205
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,839
- My dad is long dead!
- Jiang Mian!

206
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,240
Jiang Mian!

207
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:23,480
I'm… I'm your dad.

208
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,560
You hit me.

209
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,080
Leave!

210
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,400
You're free.

211
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,400
Go wherever you want!

212
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:40,320
Zheng Yu,

213
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,760
go back to campus first.

214
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,160
He just needs to cool off.

215
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:45,560
He won't lend you money.

216
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:46,760
Don't worry.

217
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:48,400
I… I'll figure something out.

218
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:52,160
Find some time to pack your things.

219
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,440
Don't stay here anymore.

220
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:57,320
What do you mean?
I'll just apologize to him later.

221
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:02,360
I'll call Ms. Sun.

222
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:06,160
After school starts,
you can live on campus.

223
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:09,760
You'll be a third-year student.
You can't continue on like this.

224
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,680
No.

225
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:14,320
Zheng Yu, one semester of boarding
costs 2,000 yuan.

226
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,840
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

227
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,520
Do as I say.

228
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:21,880
I'll take care of it.

229
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,760
<i>Chen Yanzhou,</i>

230
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:46,200
<i>Ms. Yang covered the bill</i>
<i>for my mom's emergency treatment.</i>

231
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:48,120
<i>Can you lend me…</i>

232
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:09,000
<i>I want to borrow some money from you.</i>

233
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,000
YOU RECALLED A MESSAGE

234
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:27,200
CHEN YANZHOU

235
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:32,200
- Hello?
<i>- Did something happen?</i>

236
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:36,520
- No.
<i>- Then why did you recall the message?</i>

237
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,040
<i>Where are you?</i>

238
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:41,640
<i>I'll come find you.</i>

239
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,920
No.

240
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:50,080
Okay. I have something to give you anyway.

241
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:20,320
<i>There's a research institute in Germany</i>
<i>working on a cancer cell research project.</i>

242
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:23,800
They've opened internship positions
to college students worldwide.

243
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:26,200
I think he should give it a try.

244
00:20:27,600 --> 00:20:29,400
<i>He's still young</i>

245
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:31,680
<i>and doesn't know</i>
<i>that he has other options.</i>

246
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,000
<i>You can't go abroad with him.</i>

247
00:20:36,760 --> 00:20:38,200
Would he stay for you?

248
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:41,240
Or do you plan to have him pay

249
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:42,920
<i>for you to go with him?</i>

250
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,880
<i>And what did I hear from Wu Liang?</i>

251
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,920
You got a rich boyfriend.

252
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,320
Here's my suggestion.

253
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:53,640
Rein in your nasty temper.

254
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:54,880
If you make him happy

255
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,760
<i>and tie him down,</i>

256
00:20:57,840 --> 00:21:00,120
<i>you'll get to live the good life, yeah?</i>

257
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,360
Zheng Yu.

258
00:21:06,280 --> 00:21:07,160
Spacing out?

259
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,040
It's nothing.

260
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:19,080
You have something to give me. What is it?

261
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:26,680
This is information
on the Haeckel Institute

262
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:29,080
and a few of the professors'
research projects.

263
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:31,440
I asked an alumna
to help put this together.

264
00:21:31,520 --> 00:21:34,640
It should be useful for your interview.

265
00:21:36,840 --> 00:21:38,400
I'm not going to the interview.

266
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:42,720
I didn't know that Li Yanan had
submitted an application.

267
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:45,960
I know.

268
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:49,400
Then why are you giving me this?

269
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:59,320
Do you know something?

270
00:22:00,040 --> 00:22:03,160
My mom spent her life living for others.

271
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:05,880
For my dad,

272
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:07,080
for me,

273
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,200
and for my brother.

274
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,760
And for my uncle.

275
00:22:12,440 --> 00:22:15,000
Back then, she always used to say to me,

276
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:18,160
"Xiaoyu, don't be like me."

277
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:22,520
I didn't understand
what she meant at the time.

278
00:22:23,560 --> 00:22:26,240
I thought she just
didn't want me to suffer.

279
00:22:27,640 --> 00:22:29,040
Later, I understood.

280
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:31,400
She wanted to tell me…

281
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:38,040
not to sacrifice who I can become
for anyone else's sake.

282
00:22:41,280 --> 00:22:45,560
The series of unexpected situations
that have occurred recently

283
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,560
brought me clarity.

284
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:51,680
Right now,

285
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:55,280
I don't have the right to think about
anything other than surviving.

286
00:22:58,040 --> 00:22:59,160
What lies ahead

287
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:01,880
is a pile of problems
that I need to solve.

288
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,080
My brother.

289
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:05,520
My studies.

290
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:06,840
Debt.

291
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:14,000
I truly can't take on

292
00:23:14,600 --> 00:23:16,800
the burden of another person's future.

293
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:20,080
So

294
00:23:21,040 --> 00:23:22,760
you have to pass the interview.

295
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,400
Chen Yanzhou,

296
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:39,360
let's not plan detours for anyone

297
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:42,280
or make sacrifices for anyone.

298
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:45,560
Let's each keep going
in the direction we're meant to go.

299
00:23:49,760 --> 00:23:50,880
All right.

300
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:53,200
But Zheng Yu?

301
00:23:55,320 --> 00:23:57,480
The fact that I like you

302
00:23:57,560 --> 00:24:01,480
has nothing to do with
whether you have troubles

303
00:24:01,560 --> 00:24:02,720
or whether I stay.

304
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:05,960
I told you before.

305
00:24:06,040 --> 00:24:08,160
I'm not looking for an answer.

306
00:24:11,280 --> 00:24:14,320
As long as you need me, I'll be here.

307
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:33,440
Mom.

308
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,240
When you were 14,

309
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:51,320
I gave this umbrella to you.

310
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:53,200
You still have it.

311
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:55,520
Of course.

312
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:59,920
You said it could shield me from rain
and stay with me for a long time.

313
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:05,520
Mom,

314
00:27:05,600 --> 00:27:06,440
you can walk now.

315
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,400
So

316
00:27:11,520 --> 00:27:12,840
this is a dream.

317
00:27:20,080 --> 00:27:21,120
Mom.

318
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:25,120
Ever since you fell ill,

319
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:27,240
you haven't visited me.

320
00:27:28,560 --> 00:27:30,000
How come you came today?

321
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:34,840
I came to tell you

322
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:39,840
that although the umbrella can
shield you from the rain,

323
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:41,840
you still

324
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:44,440
have to walk your own path.

325
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:50,560
I understand.

326
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:53,280
Ever since you became sick,

327
00:27:53,360 --> 00:27:54,880
I have walked by myself.

328
00:27:58,520 --> 00:28:00,600
I mean a longer

329
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:02,720
and farther path.

330
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,600
Xiaoyu,

331
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,840
many such moments

332
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,320
will occur from now on.

333
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:21,160
But remember.

334
00:28:22,800 --> 00:28:24,480
Even if you are alone,

335
00:28:25,200 --> 00:28:26,120
don't be afraid.

336
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:29,200
Keep moving forward.

337
00:28:30,560 --> 00:28:31,760
The sky

338
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,560
will clear up.

339
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,560
Mom, look!

340
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:21,760
Mom.

341
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:36,080
Mom!

342
00:30:01,280 --> 00:30:02,360
Mom.

343
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:34,840
Hello?

344
00:30:36,120 --> 00:30:37,200
Today?

345
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:39,720
Okay, I see.

346
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:52,600
Zheng Yu, you're up.

347
00:30:52,680 --> 00:30:53,880
Eat some breakfast.

348
00:30:55,560 --> 00:30:57,720
I just got a call from an upperclassman.

349
00:30:57,800 --> 00:30:59,840
They need a part-timer.
I have to go.

350
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:02,520
Go on. We'll wait for you to return.

351
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:06,200
I'll be working until curfew.

352
00:31:06,280 --> 00:31:08,200
We'll keep an eye on the door.

353
00:31:08,280 --> 00:31:09,960
We won't let them lock you out.

354
00:31:11,240 --> 00:31:14,160
I meant that you should go home.

355
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:16,280
I'm fine.

356
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:17,560
I'll be very busy soon.

357
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:20,040
Even if you stay,

358
00:31:20,120 --> 00:31:21,840
you might not see me much.

359
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:25,920
Then…

360
00:31:26,840 --> 00:31:28,280
Okay.

361
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:30,040
Text us if you need anything.

362
00:31:30,120 --> 00:31:31,560
Or call us.

363
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:50,560
The break ended too soon.

364
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:52,160
It felt long to me.

365
00:32:53,120 --> 00:32:57,400
Someone like you who applied
to be in prison wouldn't understand.

366
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:59,680
- Prison?
- Yes.

367
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:01,960
How is boarding any different from prison?

368
00:33:02,040 --> 00:33:03,120
What's bad about prison?

369
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:05,000
What kind of blasphemy is that?

370
00:33:05,080 --> 00:33:07,200
Don't let a police officer hear that.

371
00:33:07,800 --> 00:33:10,640
Compared to living
under the same roof as someone I hate,

372
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:12,960
I'd prefer solitary confinement.

373
00:33:13,040 --> 00:33:16,120
Besides, how is school
considered a prison?

374
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:18,840
School is the best place for me.

375
00:33:18,920 --> 00:33:21,280
How did you escape from
the dragon's clutches

376
00:33:21,360 --> 00:33:22,800
and sneak these treasures out?

377
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:24,440
He likes to drink.

378
00:33:24,520 --> 00:33:26,680
When he's drunk, nothing can wake him up.

379
00:33:26,760 --> 00:33:29,240
- That's it?
- What did you expect?

380
00:33:29,320 --> 00:33:30,800
I thought you two went at it,

381
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,840
and you knocked him out cold.

382
00:33:33,800 --> 00:33:35,800
Don't let a police officer hear that.

383
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:40,760
Has my sister contacted you lately?

384
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:45,120
No, Ms. Zheng hasn't come over
to my house in a long time.

385
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:49,000
I think her advisor told her
to go on a work trip out of town.

386
00:33:49,080 --> 00:33:51,120
Her whole group went.

387
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:53,120
Yanzhou was supposed to go too,

388
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:55,040
but he went abroad.

389
00:33:58,360 --> 00:34:01,440
In the past, when Chen Huimei was busy,

390
00:34:01,520 --> 00:34:03,640
at least I had Yanzhou
and Ms. Zheng around.

391
00:34:04,360 --> 00:34:05,360
Now great.

392
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,720
They're both gone.

393
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:09,480
When they get even busier,
who will hang out with me?

394
00:34:13,199 --> 00:34:16,800
Why don't I also apply
for boarding this semester?

395
00:34:17,560 --> 00:34:18,920
Why are you asking me?

396
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:21,040
You should ask Chen Huimei.

397
00:34:21,120 --> 00:34:23,239
Why are you calling my mom
by her full name?

398
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:24,960
You infected me.

399
00:34:25,040 --> 00:34:27,320
Infect? Am I some kind of virus?

400
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,880
Don't pick a fight.

401
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:33,239
Why do you have so many waxberries
in your suitcase?

402
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:34,239
Do you like them?

403
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,840
You can have them all.

404
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:38,239
Finally, something nice from you.

405
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:55,280
Chen Yanzhou.

406
00:34:57,840 --> 00:34:59,880
You're here? I thought
you couldn't make it.

407
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:03,040
I asked Professor Qiu for a half-day off.

408
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:04,920
Are you heading out?

409
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,400
My flight is at 3:00 p.m.

410
00:35:08,240 --> 00:35:10,840
I can't go with you to the airport.

411
00:35:12,640 --> 00:35:14,000
You're already seeing me off.

412
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:19,840
We won't be able
to see each other for a long time.

413
00:35:20,640 --> 00:35:22,280
I will miss you.

414
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:25,040
Will you miss me?

415
00:35:32,520 --> 00:35:34,680
I mean as a friend.

416
00:35:37,640 --> 00:35:38,480
I will.

417
00:35:41,600 --> 00:35:43,640
Contact me if anything happens.

418
00:35:47,720 --> 00:35:49,040
And when nothing's happening.

419
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:56,560
You'll be busy in the coming year.

420
00:35:57,280 --> 00:36:00,080
I'll try to message you less
and not bother you too much.

421
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:03,200
Why don't I email you?

422
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:04,720
Reply if you want, or not.

423
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:09,320
Yanzhou, come take a look.

424
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:10,920
Are you bringing these?

425
00:36:11,840 --> 00:36:13,040
Coming!

426
00:36:13,120 --> 00:36:15,000
Hurry up. We have to go soon.

427
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:17,880
You should bring this too.

428
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:21,000
You're going to be running late.

429
00:36:21,080 --> 00:36:22,840
I'll be going, then.

430
00:36:23,640 --> 00:36:25,040
Safe travels.

431
00:36:26,360 --> 00:36:27,360
Zheng Yu.

432
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,240
As a farewell…

433
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,320
how about a hug?

434
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:51,680
Chen Yanzhou, I wish you all the best.

435
00:37:07,080 --> 00:37:08,040
Take care of yourself.

436
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:36,640
MS. YANG
2,500 YUAN SENT

437
00:37:36,720 --> 00:37:38,160
<i>Ms. Yang, I'm sorry</i>

438
00:37:38,240 --> 00:37:39,800
<i>for paying you so late.</i>

439
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:42,040
<i>I will find a way</i>
<i>to come up with the rest.</i>

440
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:54,720
<i>Xiaomian already gave me the money.</i>

441
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:55,760
<i>Didn't you know?</i>

442
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:03,080
Where did Xiaomian get so much money?

443
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,920
Zheng Yu, you wanted to see me?

444
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:19,080
- Have you adjusted to boarding?
- It's pretty good.

445
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,640
Has Jiang Haixing…?

446
00:38:21,720 --> 00:38:22,760
He came to campus once.

447
00:38:23,480 --> 00:38:25,880
After the teacher lectured him,
he hasn't come back.

448
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:31,560
Did you ask him for money?

449
00:38:32,360 --> 00:38:33,360
I didn't.

450
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:37,040
Then where did you get the money
to repay Ms. Yang?

451
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:43,440
It was Yanzhou.

452
00:38:45,160 --> 00:38:47,200
He came to see me before going abroad.

453
00:38:48,080 --> 00:38:49,400
Chen Yanzhou?

454
00:38:54,640 --> 00:38:56,520
Take these waxberries and try them.

455
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:01,840
I brought them to visit Ms. Yang just now.

456
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:03,880
I accidentally brought too many.

457
00:39:03,960 --> 00:39:06,760
I don't have anyone to give them to,
so you can have them.

458
00:39:07,480 --> 00:39:10,160
Did you ask to meet me just for this?

459
00:39:11,560 --> 00:39:12,560
No.

460
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:14,360
I just sent you money.

461
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:17,080
Use it to repay Ms. Yang.

462
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:24,360
I only heard when I went to the hospital

463
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:27,520
that Ms. Yang had covered
your mom's emergency treatment bill.

464
00:39:28,480 --> 00:39:31,840
Your sister will feel bad
about owing her for too long.

465
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:35,960
Since you visited Ms. Yang,
why didn't you give it to her directly?

466
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:41,360
If I give it, Ms. Yang won't accept it
because I'm in no position to do that.

467
00:39:42,120 --> 00:39:43,320
But you're different.

468
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:45,200
Xiaomian,

469
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,960
you're her brother, her family.

470
00:39:51,320 --> 00:39:54,160
If my sister finds out,
what should I tell her?

471
00:40:00,520 --> 00:40:01,640
Give her this letter.

472
00:40:11,400 --> 00:40:14,080
<i>I don't know</i>
<i>when you will find out about this.</i>

473
00:40:15,080 --> 00:40:17,400
<i>If it's before I leave,</i>

474
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:20,880
<i>I'm sure you will</i>
<i>definitely come looking for me.</i>

475
00:40:22,240 --> 00:40:23,240
<i>I still remember that time.</i>

476
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:26,560
<i>You insisted on</i>
<i>returning 10,000 yuan to me.</i>

477
00:40:27,400 --> 00:40:31,480
<i>If you were to look at me like that again,</i>

478
00:40:33,240 --> 00:40:35,200
<i>I don't think I would be able to leave.</i>

479
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:39,000
<i>That's why I wrote this letter.</i>

480
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:43,160
<i>I earned this money myself.</i>

481
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:45,280
<i>Don't forget,</i>

482
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:47,920
<i>we used to be fierce rivals.</i>

483
00:40:48,520 --> 00:40:49,960
<i>Just like you,</i>

484
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:51,760
<i>I've received several scholarships.</i>

485
00:40:52,840 --> 00:40:54,560
<i>Don't rush to pay me back.</i>

486
00:40:54,640 --> 00:40:57,640
<i>Consider this another collaboration.</i>

487
00:40:59,080 --> 00:41:01,160
<i>This year passed by too quickly.</i>

488
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:03,520
<i>I never imagined</i>

489
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:06,240
<i>my life would change so drastically</i>

490
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:08,400
<i>because of one person I met.</i>

491
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:12,720
<i>This period of time is</i>
<i>a precious chapter in my life.</i>

492
00:41:13,680 --> 00:41:15,760
<i>It helped me rediscover myself.</i>

493
00:41:16,720 --> 00:41:18,120
<i>Therefore,</i>

494
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:21,800
<i>it's only natural</i>
<i>that I understand you too.</i>

495
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:26,880
<i>So please accept this support</i>
<i>without reservations.</i>

496
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:31,520
<i>Just like how we once</i>
<i>gave each other comfort,</i>

497
00:41:31,600 --> 00:41:32,720
<i>courage,</i>

498
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:34,880
<i>and determination.</i>

499
00:41:37,280 --> 00:41:38,360
<i>Zheng Yu,</i>

500
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:42,040
<i>as we each head in our own directions,</i>

501
00:41:42,120 --> 00:41:44,280
<i>I'll be rooting for you from afar.</i>

502
00:41:44,360 --> 00:41:49,800
<i>And I hope our reunions will always</i>
<i>outnumber our farewells by one.</i>

503
00:41:52,520 --> 00:41:53,600
If only

504
00:41:53,680 --> 00:41:55,520
Yanzhou hadn't gone abroad.

505
00:41:56,560 --> 00:41:57,880
Then you wouldn't be alone.

506
00:42:00,520 --> 00:42:04,000
Sometimes, your only wish for someone

507
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:05,880
is for them to keep shining.

508
00:42:06,520 --> 00:42:09,360
Whether that ray of light shines on you

509
00:42:10,640 --> 00:42:12,000
isn't that important.

510
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:15,800
You and Yanzhou said
pretty much the same thing.

511
00:42:18,120 --> 00:42:19,240
<i>Are you helping my sister</i>

512
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:22,320
because you want to pursue her?

513
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:28,280
I just

514
00:42:29,080 --> 00:42:30,960
don't want to see her held back by this.

515
00:42:32,640 --> 00:42:34,920
She is someone who was meant to shine.

516
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:39,240
Getting to see her
do the things she wants to do

517
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:40,640
is enough for me.
